  it('adds two numbers correctly', () => {
    expect(1 + 2).toBe(3);
  });

  it('returns a string', () => {
    expect(typeof 'hello').toBe('string');
  });
});
```

Tests pass when all `expect` calls succeed. A single failed assertion fails the whole test.

